&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: left"&gt;                                  (245 Summer Street, Boston, Massachusetts 02210, USA)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: left"&gt;保有株券等の数                    株式  1,741,492株&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: left"&gt;株券等保有割合                    6.34％&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
